        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roloc is a scheduling puzzle game that is simple yet requires deep thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You clear each stage by strategically using the given workers to remove all boxes on the stage. Each worker possesses the ability to remove boxes matching their specific color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the <i>chances</i> you are given are not that many. While you start with ample chances, you will soon find that without a sophisticated strategy, clearing the stages becomes impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, new colors and new gimmicks emerge with each group. Is the strategy you've built up so far truly ready to embrace <i>these new elements</i>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game interface that's intuitive, not complicated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant colors and themes tailored to your taste</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And countless stages that leave no room for boredom!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roloc is a scheduling puzzle game that is simple yet requires deep thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You clear each stage by strategically using the given workers to remove all boxes on the stage. Each worker possesses the ability to remove boxes matching their specific color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the <i>chances</i> you are given are not that many. While you start with ample chances, you will soon find that without a sophisticated strategy, clearing the stages becomes impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, new colors and new gimmicks emerge with each group. Is the strategy you've built up so far truly ready to embrace <i>these new elements</i>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game interface that's intuitive, not complicated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant colors and themes tailored to your taste</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And countless stages that leave no room for boredom!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Roloc will guide you to have a delightful yet challenging scheduling adventure with colorful boxes.",
